IsAllowed_YieldRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given vault never allowlisted
│  └── it should return false
└── given vault allowlisted
   ├── given a different yieldVault
   │  └── it should return false
   └── given the same yieldVault
      ├── it should return true
      └── given the entry was later cleared
         └── it should return false
